        "prefix_token_count": 149,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: To eliminate the cube root, raise both sides of the equation to the power of 3: \\((\\sqrt[3]{(x-2)^2})^3 = 16^3\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 531,
