        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Simplify the left side to get \\((x-2)^2 = 16^3\\). Calculate \\(16^3\\): \\(16^3 = 4096\\), so the equation becomes \\((x-2)^2 = 4096\\)."
      },
      {
